WEBVTT

00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.780
Good thing you're a fisher-samurai, Kojiro!

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.090
<i>There's no way...</i>

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.290
<i>I'd be satisfied </i>just<i> 
being the self-sufficient guy.</i>

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:39.630
We can see the whole town from up here.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.990
Where's my steel horse?

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:45.730
There it is!

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.310
They took our weapons and stuff, too.

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:50.020
We better find all of it.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:51.880
It's morning...

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.890
Hey, Musashi, look over there.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:04.510
Something's coming!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:39.930
<b>Choosing Tomorrow</b>

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.110
<i>What should I do?!</i>

00:02:44.110 --> 00:02:45.970
<i>Someone tell me!</i>

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:47.300
Tsugumi!

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:49.810
My Lord!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.510
There are signs of an incoming attack.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.570
We're going to begin mobilizing 
the entire castle town.

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.830
Hand out swords to everyone.

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:03.580
Tell them to become heroes who 
defend their home from oni!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:06.800
But that's...

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:15.310
I'm counting on you, Tsugumi.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:18.180
N...

00:03:19.940 --> 00:03:20.730
N...

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:23.770
<i>If there's something you gotta get out,</i>

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:27.220
<i>why not just say it?</i>

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:28.890
<i>That's right.</i>

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:32.160
What's with that look?

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.280
The total mobilization...

00:03:34.930 --> 00:03:36.350
I'm against it!

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:43.570
I'm... not backing down anymore!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.950
My daughter is turning against me...

00:03:49.320 --> 00:03:52.260
Do you have any idea how much 
this saddens me, Tsugumi?

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.350
For most of your life, 
I've treated you, an orphan,

00:03:58.200 --> 00:04:01.870
like you were my own flesh and blood.

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:04.030
M-My Lord...

00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:07.290
But it seems you don't 
understand my love.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:11.500
Your Lordship?!

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:14.560
You...

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.100
are of no further use.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.810
Get out of my castle.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.800
You are no longer a member of this band.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:27.790
No one will pay you any mind ever again.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.600
Live out the rest of your days 
alone in the wilderness.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.410
<i>Alone...?</i>

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:43.690
If you do as I say, we can act
 like this never happened.

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:47.890
I'll praise your efforts, guide you,
 and let you live in my castle.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:52.970
I'll listen... Please don't abandon me.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:56.100
Good girl.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.490
See?

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:08.790
You can't do anything without me. 
You can't even survive.

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:13.860
If you understand now, then get to work.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.220
Tsubame...

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.680
I'm a useless idiot.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.350
That's right, Tsubame!

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:37.770
You're so useless, you can't 
do anything without me!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:41.410
You just need to do what I tell you!

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:42.170
Yes, sir.

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:44.370
Are you worth anything at all?!

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.950
I understand now.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:52.190
After hearing all that day in and day out,

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:54.690
it wore away your confidence 
until you couldn't think at all.

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.880
It must've been so frustrating...

00:05:57.770 --> 00:05:59.930
It must've made you feel so pathetic.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:06.480
I've made up my mind...

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:10.120
I'm going to defy His Lordship 
and protect the people in town.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:11.780
So...

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:15.610
Please, give me the courage, big sister!

00:06:15.610 --> 00:06:16.520
<i>Tsugumi.</i>

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.230
<i>You can't do anything without me.</i>

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.190
Your Lordship...

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:26.870
<i>If you defy me, I'll chase 
you out of this castle.</i>

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:29.390
<i>The place you belong, 
the people that need you,</i>

00:06:29.390 --> 00:06:33.710
<i>everything that you ever cared 
about all belongs to me.</i>

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:39.500
<i>How could you possibly go on 
living without all of that?</i>

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.460
<i>But... I'm doing it anyway!</i>

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.960
<i>I'm not going to do what you say anymore.</i>

00:06:48.350 --> 00:06:50.010
<i>I'm going to protect everyone,</i>

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.970
<i>the way my sister did!</i>

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:57.520
Wh-Why...?

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.950
Why can't I do it?

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:02.150
<i>Tsugumi.</i>

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:06.390
<i>You just need to do as I tell you!</i>

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.060
N-No!

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.380
Get off me!

00:07:28.330 --> 00:07:30.560
Wh-What are you guys doing here?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.720
Any chance you know where our swords are?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:36.920
This is bad! His Lordship said you must 
stay locked up until he wishes!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.760
It's all "His Lordship" with you...

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.480
But who even is that guy to you?

00:07:42.470 --> 00:07:43.540
He...

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:46.980
Who cares what the so-called lord has to say?

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.190
But...

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:53.030
I'm so weak... and dumb...

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.550
Without him,

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.800
I can't do anything.

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.750
Weak? <i>You</i>?

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.330
Nah. You kicked Kojiro's butt.

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.500
That makes you pretty strong.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.260
Shut it.

00:08:06.700 --> 00:08:08.620
Besides, you're pretty smart.

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:13.370
You seem to know more 
about oni hunting than we do,

00:08:13.370 --> 00:08:16.630
and that light-up weapon on 
your arms is pretty cool.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.090
You're really something else!

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:25.930
Here come the oni.

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:31.930
Let's go. We'll give you a lift.

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:35.060
You're a Bushi. You're not just 
gonna stand there, are you?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:44.140
<i>We're also doing this to protect 
people who are weaker than us.</i>

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:47.140
<i>That's the Bushi way, Tsugumi.</i>

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:52.600
I'll show you to your swords.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:54.250
In exchange...

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.370
there's something I need your help with.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.720
It's a huge swarm of kodama oni!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:24.630
We'll have to crash that square 
to make sure everyone can escape.

00:09:25.390 --> 00:09:28.610
Wouldn't he just attack 
the townspeople that way?

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:29.570
Let's go!

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:30.570
Hold your horses.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:32.620
You're just the driver, so quit talking!

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:34.390
<i>Just</i> the driver?!

00:09:34.390 --> 00:09:37.580
Don't the low-ranking guys 
usually get stuck driving?

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.090
Are you mocking me?!

00:09:40.090 --> 00:09:43.590
You just haven't seen how
impressive he really is.

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:44.610
He's impressive?

00:09:44.610 --> 00:09:49.380
At the end of the day, 
you can always count on Kojiro.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:52.290
Hey, you really think so?

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:54.080
You bet I do!

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.530
Can I really trust you two?

00:09:58.100 --> 00:10:03.290
We just want to ensure 
the townsfolk get to safety, right?

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:06.670
You got a plan, Kojiro?

00:10:08.550 --> 00:10:10.970
Our final stand against the blue oni

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:13.200
that infest these lands is upon us!

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:16.860
In thirty minutes, 
they will force their way here.

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:18.700
And we will be victorious!

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:22.790
We will bring the full strength of our 
band to bear and scatter these oni!

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:26.130
But to do that, 
the oni need to be delayed.

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:30.010
The honor of that duty will falls to you,
the people of this fief.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:33.240
I'm sure you're all thrilled 
to be able to join the battle.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:37.590
B-But... we've never done anything 
but tend the fields before.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:41.190
What in the world is he thinking?

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:45.530
I've always thought it was a shame 
that those of you who aren't Bushi

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:48.570
will never know the glory of battle.

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.510
Today... that changes.

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:53.540
Now the joy will finally be yours!

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.440
War is a feast. 
Make sure you get your fill!

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:02.470
No way... I don't want to die!

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:04.410
We can't escape.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.300
Is our only option to die...?

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:10.720
Wh-What is that?!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.350
There's smoke...

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:13.720
Who goes there?!

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:18.240
Are you behind this...

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.790
Tsugumi?!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.900
My Lord, total mobilization 
is completely out of the question.

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:26.610
A Bushi's duty is to defend the people.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:31.200
Sending all non-combatants into 
battle would shame any true Bushi!

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:34.200
Isn't fleeing from the enemy 
the true shame of a Bushi?!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.860
Bushi bands exist to battle the oni!

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:42.680
And I'm saying it's idiotic to clash 
with the kodama horde head-on.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.270
They may be weak individually,

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:49.310
but when swarming, they have destructive 
power comparable to a tornado!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:52.330
I believe it's best 
to take cover until they pass,

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:55.060
and then request aid from 
Lord Tokugawa in the central territory!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.790
Where exactly is the need 
for additional aid?!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:01.780
The only thing I'm sending home are oni heads!

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.740
What's the point of collecting kodama heads?!

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:08.140
Wouldn't the Kosameda Band be better off

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:11.270
saving our strength for the 
day that we slay a Kishin?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.970
Please, try to convince 
His Lordship, Tsugumi!

00:12:15.450 --> 00:12:20.050
<i>My job is actually to keep his attention 
on me as long as possible...</i>

00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:22.920
<i>If I can do that, the others can escape.</i>

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.060
That's funny, Tsugumi.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:29.640
I don't remember you ever 
being such a smooth talker.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.430
Is this some kind of scheme?

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:38.440
My men will cut down any would-be deserters.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.760
He saw through me...

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:44.320
Maybe I really can't do 
anything against him.

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:49.040
No one's awake to take your crappy 
commands anymore, Kosameda Hideo.

00:12:57.030 --> 00:12:58.260
What is the meaning of this?

00:12:58.260 --> 00:13:01.930
We used the smoke to take 
out all of your guards.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:04.710
You were too busy speechifying to notice.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:08.710
We could see where they were 
from above pretty easily,

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:12.550
so all we needed was a bit 
of cover to take them down.

00:13:13.110 --> 00:13:17.130
No one's gonna stop everybody
 from fleeing now, yeah?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.860
Yeah! Thank you!

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:23.080
Come on, everyone! Get to safety!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:24.910
We're going to get through this!

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:33.040
Why aren't they running?

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:40.100
Everyone, flee!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:43.990
The oni are going to overrun 
the entire castle at this rate!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:45.620
All of you!

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:49.580
Desertion is a crime that will
 earn your entire family the death penalty!

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:53.360
That's it... They're all still scared of him.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:55.500
Because if they defy him,

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:57.950
the punishment will befall their families, too.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:14:01.820
But if they stay here, 
aren't they toast anyway?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:04.790
They're not really thinking.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:10.300
They're so scared of the lord that 
they can't see anything else.

00:14:11.210 --> 00:14:12.480
So what do we do?

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:19.260
I'm going...

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.940
to defeat him!

00:14:21.660 --> 00:14:26.630
To shake them awake, I have to beat 
the lord they're all so scared of!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:31.590
If I do that, they should find the 
courage to run from the castle.

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:33.340
Tsugumi...

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:37.850
What's he gonna do?

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.560
Get them into position!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.800
Drag them if you have to!

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:45.620
Yes, sir!

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.520
This is bad! They're going 
to take everyone away!

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:51.940
No! Big brother, help!

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:51.940
Stop it!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.340
You can leave these goons to us.

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:56.920
Guys...

00:14:56.920 --> 00:15:00.200
Give that jerk the beating he deserves!

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:01.660
I will!

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:07.260
My, my. A rebellious phase?

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.780
What a troublesome girl.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:21.910
What?!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:33.740
Tsugumi is fighting His Lordship
 so that we can escape...

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.960
<i>I'm going to save everyone!</i>

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.810
<i>Just like my sister would have!</i>

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:47.340
Your attacks can't touch me!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:04.900
Who do you think taught you how 
to fight in the first place?

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.320
Never stay out past curfew!

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:10.280
Never think unnecessary thoughts!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.110
Never fail to complete your training!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.040
And never, ever defy your father!

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.580
I know I told you all this!

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.290
So why can't you just do it?!

00:16:19.590 --> 00:16:23.240
You are completely worthless, Tsugumi!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:28.510
You people can't survive on your own.

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:30.750
Take away your families,

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:33.630
and the loneliness and despair 
will sap your strength away,

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:36.730
leaving you incapable of 
going on. Am I wrong?

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:37.960
Tsugumi....

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.110
Th-That's right...

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:41.690
If I lost my children, I couldn't go on.

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:43.400
You're weak.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:44.960
Weak little creatures.

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:49.410
But there's no shame in that. 
Even wild animals form groups to survive.

00:16:49.410 --> 00:16:55.490
So you all just need to keep 
doing as I tell you like always.

00:16:55.840 --> 00:17:00.450
Do as the head of your family, the head 
of this Bushi band, tells you—

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:08.470
Wha...

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:11.830
Wh-Wh-Wh... What?

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:16.960
I am done... listening to you....

00:17:16.960 --> 00:17:20.570
You can't do a damn thing without me!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.770
But I'm going to do it anyway.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:26.510
It doesn't matter how weak...
 or unsure I am...

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.720
I've decided to fight!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.490
Watch me, everyone.

00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.490
I'm not going to lose!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:35.550
That's....

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:38.700
It's like what the Takeda Band did!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:46.680
Go ahead and try me!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.720
<i>I've been afraid of this man for so long.</i>

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:59.140
<i>But now I understand.</i>

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:02.630
<i>What I truly feared was a future alone</i>

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.870
<i>after leaving him behind.</i>

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:10.700
<i>I was obeying him in order to 
maintain a place I could belong.</i>

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:13.640
<i>As long as I could put up with the pain,</i>

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.160
<i>I could stay with the people of the castle.</i>

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:19.570
Tsugumi...

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.870
Desertion in the face of battle
is punishable by death!

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:25.620
I know how you all feel!

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.610
You don't want to lose your loved ones.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.680
But even if we make it through 
today, what about tomorrow?

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:32.880
And the day after?!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:37.090
You know that as long as you follow him,
 one day, it'll cost you everything!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.800
If you really want to protect the people 
you love, now is the time to fight!

00:18:41.280 --> 00:18:43.620
To protect the people we love...

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.760
We have to fight now?

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:50.200
You're the only traitor here! 
Give it up, Tsugumi!

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:54.890
You're a stupid, weak, useless, 
worthless girl!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:56.860
So what?!

00:18:56.860 --> 00:18:59.840
Even if I'm weak, I'm doing this!

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.060
To protect the people I care about!

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.030
Take this!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:27.190
Now, everyone!

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:28.760
Yeah! We need to go!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:29.680
Hurry!

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:35.660
The oni are almost here!

00:19:36.060 --> 00:19:37.130
Move it!

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.600
Wait... Stop running...

00:19:42.070 --> 00:19:43.980
I thought a Bushi band was like a family...

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:48.210
A Bushi band... family...

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:50.210
No one...

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:54.250
should defy their father!

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.960
We should be safe here.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:09.820
Where's Tsugumi?

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.810
Run, Tsugumi!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:19.420
Somebody help her!

00:20:26.400 --> 00:20:29.480
I can run, but I won't make it in time...

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.600
Still, everyone got to safety.

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:41.250
Tsubame, I did a good job, right?

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:43.050
But...

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:48.300
I kind of wish I could have 
lived a bit longer...

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:55.630
<i>I'm gonna be a nice Bushi like you, Tsubame!</i>

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.310
I wish I could have lived...

00:21:03.310 --> 00:21:05.690
Hey! Tsugumi!

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:27.550
That was really cool back there!

00:21:27.550 --> 00:21:29.890
I knew you were something else!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:54.100
Feels great to be surrounded by beauties...

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:27.170
That move of yours was pretty slick.

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:27.980
You think so?

00:23:27.980 --> 00:23:29.530
Twin Soaring Swallows!

00:23:28.010 --> 00:23:30.470
<b>Twin Soaring Swallows!!</b>

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:32.390
Do you two have any special moves?

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:33.500
This is mine.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:35.470
<b>The ground is
 like a sheathe</b>

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:35.470
Kanemaki-Isshin Style 
sword-drawing technique...

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:36.950
Thousand Vortex Shredder!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:37.980
<b>Thousand Vortex Shredder!!</b>

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:37.970
Wow!

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:39.940
How come I don't have any...?

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>Next Time
Getting Stronger</b>
